<%# The search control. The nav and the footer share it, thus the two always agree: a copy with no
    pointerenter action and no focus action would stop the early load on that surface, and give no
    message. It is a button, and not an <a href="#">: the search needs JavaScript, thus there is no
    destination for a browser with no JavaScript. `wrapper_class`, which is a necessary local, is
    the list-item class of the menu that contains it. %>
<li class="<%= wrapper_class %>">
  <button type="button" data-controller="search" data-action="click->search#open pointerenter->search#preload focus->search#preload">Search</button>
</li>
